    "commit": {
      "message": "Add Debug Workbench D6 runtime self-test suite r2"
    },
    "notes": [
      "D6 adds read-only runtime checks for handoff routes, browser scheme readiness, completed-file access, media sniffing, redaction, notification diagnostics, recorder health, support report readiness, and state context.",
      "The suite does not start downloads, launch viewers, inspect files, open schemes, run network probes, mutate storage, or upload reports.",
      "Normal UI uses human labels and sanitized copy reports.",
      "r2 fixes RuntimeSelfTestSuiteCard spacing to use XdmSpacing.TightGap instead of a nonexistent XdmSpacing.sm alias."
    ]
